{
  "$schema": "governance_studio.approved_v2_api_operations.v1",
  "description": "The closed set of v2 operations the studio frontend may consume, including the GAS-7 HR-D review routes (display and verbatim relay only, owner ruling HR-1) and, since front-door seam 6 (FD-10), the one relayed start of the worker's own shadow run, since seam 7 (FD-11) the one read of the worker's own audit ledger by correlation id, and since seam 8 (FD-12) the typed data-use declaration intake whose only write is declare. Separate from the v1 manifest because the two contracts are frozen independently. Under owner ruling SD-2 no operation naming issue, activate, revoke, grant, authorize, clear or execute may ever appear here; verify-v2-api-boundary.mjs re-derives that from the contract rather than trusting this file.",
  "contract": "governance_studio.api.v2",
